# Auto-push to GitHub

After **any** file create/edit/delete in this repo, immediately sync to GitHub before ending your turn:

1. `git add` the changed files (never add `.env`, `*.pem`, `*.key`, or credential files)
2. `git commit` with a short message describing the change
3. `git push origin HEAD` (remote is `raitenhenry-ai/NEW-Postfin`)

Do this even for small UI tweaks. Do not wait for the user to ask. If push fails, retry once over SSH (`git@github.com:raitenhenry-ai/NEW-Postfin.git`).
